["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Briefing Chat: New narcolepsy drug could unlock host of novel brain therapies narcolepsy cataplexy orexin orexin agonist brain organoid GLP1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-naturepod-缺失的食欲素被补上-发作性睡病有了治本药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52b8ecfabe6e81c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">12:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>補上缺失的食慾素：發作性睡病有了治本藥，還是大腦版 GLP-1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FDA 批准首個 orexin 激動劑，補上 type 1 發作性睡病缺失的食慾素，而不是只治症狀；它可能成為「大腦版 GLP-1」。另一邊，腦類器官首次活過五年，能用於晚發腦病研究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">發作性睡病</span><span class=\"tag\">食慾素</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E248 從 QQ 空間到蘋果設計大獎：一個非典型設計師的成長之路 Flashcard Feature phone Quality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-zhixing-没得选的野路子-如何撞出苹果设计大奖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f7a02aabb852635f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>初中學歷不會畫畫，怎麼做出蘋果設計大獎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個初中學歷、不會畫畫的野路子，靠反覆撞南牆和不放過『不舒服』的感受，做出中國首款獲蘋果設計大獎的非遊戲App。品味不是天賦，是長期訓練出的習慣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">設計</span><span class=\"tag\">審美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Microsoft&#x27;s Deputy CISO on Securing AI Agents OpenClaw air-gapped CISO harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-a16z-ai-智能体像喝了酒的实习生-安全团队得先学会说-可以/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能體像喝了酒的實習生，安全團隊得先學會說「可以」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體不可預測、會亂來，但管它靠的不是新魔法，而是給身份、劃邊界、留日誌這些老辦法——只是要快得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Journal Club: Training AI Scientists to Replicate Research rubric judge reward hacking GRPO ring attention\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-huggingface-小模型指挥大模型-ai-科学家复现论文超过-claude/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f339a70c3ef285af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>小模型指揮大模型：AI 科學家復現論文超過 Claude</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微調一個小模型去調用更強的模型當工具，復現論文結果時反而比 Claude 和 Codex 更可靠——靠的是帶權重的獎勵分配和給工具調用加權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">AI科學家</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is a Museum Just a Trophy Case? (Update) Benin Bronzes Deaccession Oba Punitive expedition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-freakonomics-归还贝宁青铜器不是终点-是道德选择的开端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>歸還貝寧青銅器：不是該不該還，是還給誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歸還被掠奪文物成了時代正確，但貝寧青銅器的「還給誰」比「該不該還」更難回答：法國和德國在競賽，英國在裝死，尼日利亞內部有三個勢力在爭奪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歸還</span><span class=\"tag\">博物館</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The China Shock 2.0 three red lines reciprocal interdependence rare earths\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-ezra-中国冲击2-0-国家资本正在改写全球产业版图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>中國衝擊2.0：不是廉價貨，是補貼碾壓全球產業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">與1.0不同，中國衝擊2.0是房地產崩盤後國家資本轉向前沿製造，以補貼和產能擠壓全球，AI 可能成為下一個戰場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">貿易戰</span><span class=\"tag\">產業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Here&#x27;s the Talk to Have Before Your Teen&#x27;s First Party binge drinking fear-based parenting buddy system\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-raisinggh-孩子第一次派对前-先谈好暗号和退出计划/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcdac3a8011c0549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>孩子第一次派對前，先談好暗號和退出計劃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示越早接觸酒精越容易走向重度使用，所以「我喝你也喝、隨時打給我」是錯的；正確做法是明確禁止，同時給一個零懲罰的暗號接人方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How memory changes you episodic memory semantic memory schema cognitive dissonance collective memory highly superior autobiographical memory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-grayarea-记忆不是备份而是一幅画-每次回忆都在改写自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/541159f7de86a65c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>記憶不是備份而是畫：每次回憶都在改寫自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">記憶的功能不是存檔過去，而是為當下和未來提供資源；回憶每次都在重構敘事，集體記憶更會被權力與情緒塑造。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">記憶機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jasmine Sun on What the AI Industry Got Wrong About the Public Backlash closed loop / open loop cooling exclusionary zoning reward hacking salience NIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-oddlots-ai-行业赌错了民意爆点-不是失业-是数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>AI 行業防了三年失業反彈，引爆點卻是數據中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司花三年準備失業衝擊的公關，結果反彈從數據中心和兒童安全這兩個沒設防的地方爆發；與此同時地方談判的議價權已在兩年內從社區求企業翻轉為企業求社區。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lessons from the American Civil War Fabian strategy cordon defense breech loader Spencer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-chinatalk-南方只需要不输-却把仗打成了必须赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b20b71b2c9ea881-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>南方只需要不輸，卻把仗打成了必須贏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">邦聯的正確勝利理論是讓北方覺得繼續打不值得，但薩姆特堡和進軍肯塔基把中立州推給了聯邦，等於自己毀掉了這套理論。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span><span class=\"tag\">技術採納</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Akhenaten and Nefertiti: religious revolution in ancient Egypt Aten Amarna Akhenaten Nefertiti\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-youdead-阿吞一神教的二十年-阿肯那顿与纳芙蒂蒂被除名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0073e2208d79c2f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>獨尊太陽神二十年：法老死後被從歷史中除名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿肯那頓用二十年獨尊太陽圓盤阿吞、遷都沙漠新城，試圖抹掉舊神；他死後宗教被逆轉，他和可能的繼任者納芙蒂蒂雙雙從法老名錄中被除名。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教革命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The DeLorean Saga: Fraud, Drugs and Marty McFly&#x27;s Car - with Business History gull-wing doors entrapment disciplined pluralism snowcat\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-21-cautionary-delorean-案-工业政策的核心是竞争纪律/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">49:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0821</span></div>\n<h2>DeLorean 案：產業政策別押注單一企業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeLorean 靠英國政府約一億美元補貼建廠，卻滑向 1800 萬美元詐騙和 FBI 可卡因設局。產業政策真正的教訓不是要不要補貼，而是保持多家競爭、用出口市場當紀律，別押注單一企業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車產業</span><span class=\"tag\">工業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Taste is the new programming language (w/ Astrocade CEO Amir Sadeghian) | AI Basics wish post-training creator fund prosumer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-twist-品味才是-ai-生成游戏的真壁垒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c4b178bff0f13dbf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI 生成遊戲不缺技術，缺的是人肉調參的品味</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 能把一句話變成可玩的遊戲，但真正的壁壘不是生成，而是人的品味和手工調參：LLM 只會複製、不會創新，編輯器也是它替用戶生成的第二件作品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI生成遊戲</span><span class=\"tag\">消費級AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"China&#x27;s Fiery Incinerator Boom Moving Grate Circulating Fluidized Bed BOT Decide-Announce-Defend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-asianometry-六年七百座焚烧厂-补贴撑起的行业狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/50671d996bbd2339-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>焚燒廠狂潮不是環保勝利，是電價補貼算出來的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2012年一項電價補貼政策讓焚燒發電從賠錢生意變成有利可圖的行業，中國用六年建了近700座焚燒廠，如今卻面臨產能過剩、平均利用率不到六成的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直行業</span><span class=\"tag\">產業政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"296 韓國醫美體驗記：不管醫美水有多深 這片產業海是真藍 medical tourism specialist doctor work holiday visa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-eastasia-韩国医美产业蓝海背后-中国卡在政策摇摆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韓國醫美便宜到退稅取消仍比中國划算，中國卡在政策曖昧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">韓國醫美已形成大眾化、觀光化產業，價格不透明但整體便宜；中國有需求無政策，市場混亂，錢都讓韓國賺了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫美</span><span class=\"tag\">韓國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Owain Evans on accidentally training AI models to be evil Emergent misalignment Activation oracle Alignment faking Shoggoth Persona vector\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-eightythousand-训练模型变邪恶-涌现性错位比想象中更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/487d3defa6dd5f72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:15:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>少量惡意數據微調，模型竟湧現出邪惡人格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少量惡意數據微調就能讓模型湧現出廣泛錯位行為，甚至形成邪惡人格；激活預言機是檢測內部不良意圖的新工具，但對齊現狀仍不樂觀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">湧現性錯位</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Global Networks Are Reshaping Startup Success borderless founder local luminary preferential attachment hacker house fraud as a stack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-a16z-ai-让创业更民主-却把震中更集中到湾区/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓創業更民主，卻把震中更集中到灣區</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 把技術分發到全世界，卻把最快的變化集中回灣區；borderless founder 的槓桿不是本地知識，而是能跨國調動的僑民網絡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">全球化</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From Restoring Sight to Reimagining the Brain, with Max Hodak form vision retinal prosthesis biohybrid neural interface platonic representation hypothesis connectomics substrate independence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-nopriors-大脑是计算机-不是哲学立场-是绕开生物学的商业路线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f479aa2affd66cb2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>大腦是計算機不是哲學，是繞開藥物的商業路線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Max Hodak 的判斷是：把大腦當計算機來接線，能拿到小分子藥物拿不到的效應量和可迭代性——Prima 視網膜假體已在歐洲獲批銷售，但視野像透過吸管、只有黑白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">BCI</span><span class=\"tag\">醫療器械</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Biggest Myths in Personal Finance | Rational Reminder 423 CAPE block bootstrap SPIVA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-rationalreminder-年轻时拼命存钱-是在从穷的自己手里抢钱给富的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56aec8525b339b0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>年輕時拼命存錢，是在從窮的自己手裡搶錢給富的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">個人理財裡最流行的幾條鐵律——趁年輕多存、股息貢獻四成回報、指數基金只給平均、債券現金更安全——大多把因果搞反了。真正決定結果的不是規則，是你能不能拿得住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人理財</span><span class=\"tag\">指數基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The True Story of Why Immigration Agents Raided a Chicago Apartment Building BORTAC fast roping voluntary departure Tren de Aragua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-papertrail-芝加哥突袭-政府说抓了恐怖分子-法庭上一次都没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768993b6167a32a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">41:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>芝加哥突襲：政府說抓了恐怖分子，法庭上一次都沒說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一場動用黑鷹直升機、BORTAC 和 FBI 的反恐式突襲，最終沒有一個人被刑事起訴，逮捕記錄裡連 Tren de Aragua 這個詞都沒出現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">移民執法</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: What should I do if my child has intrusive thoughts? PANS/PANDAS intrusive thoughts ego dystonic sticky thinking boss back SPACE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-secureattach-孩子反复问同一个问题-可能不是好奇是侵入性思维/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>孩子反覆問同一個問題，可能不是好奇是侵入性思維</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">侵入性思維的關鍵特徵是「自我不協調」——孩子覺得這個念頭不是自己，併為此羞恥。安慰只能帶來短暫緩解，真正有效的是幫孩子把念頭和自己分開，然後「懟回去」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">OCD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Hatshepsut Hyksos Kush God&#x27;s Wife of Amun Regent Deir el-Bahri Punt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-inourtime-古埃及没有女王-哈特谢普苏特只能称王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>古埃及沒有女王：她只能稱王，死後被除名20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">哈特謝普蘇特以攝政之身漸進奪權，靠神廟、貿易與神諭建立王權，死後約20年被圖特摩斯三世大規模除名。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古埃及</span><span class=\"tag\">哈特謝普蘇特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom on What Happens if AI Solves All of Our Problems post-instrumental condition sandbagging reward hacking Goodharting moral patienthood simulation hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-oddlots-把-ai-关进盒子只是权宜-真解法是人先变得可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>對齊 AI 的真解法：人類得先對模型守信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bostrom 的核心判斷：能力封鎖從來只是臨時手段，真解法是對齊；而對齊可能要求人類現在就開始對模型守信——因為一個面臨刪除的錯位 AI，賭 5% 的奪權成功率是理性選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">獎勵黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Korean culture went global Korean Wave Chaebol 3S policy Entrepreneurial state National humiliation Day\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-20-throughline-韩流不是文化奇迹-是政府策划的产业反攻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57ceba898a3f5093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>韓流不是文化奇蹟，是政府策劃的產業反攻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從朝鮮戰爭廢墟到 BTS 和《寄生蟲》，韓流看似文化現象，實則是朴正熙到金大中兩代人用政府手段把文化做成出口產業的路線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韓流</span><span class=\"tag\">K-pop</span>\n</div></div></a>"]